        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=de" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        How you delete your data on Android (and iPhone) is set out on the page
        <a href="/loeschen/">Konto und Daten löschen</a> (in German).
